<description>&lt;p&gt;China's coast guard continues to monitor Philippine resupply missions to the grounded warship at the disputed shoal and has shadowed a U.S. warship nearby, while Chinese warships and a research vessel were sighted near Bajo de Masinloc. The Philippines is expanding cooperation with Taiwan to protect undersea cables, and Taiwan has expressed openness to joint cable-protection efforts. An ex-NSA urged activation of the Philippines-China coast guard agreement, and the Philippine coast guard rescued four people on Hagonoy Island. Coast Guard personnel were killed and another wounded in a Cotabato City shooting. 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPTU9McVh3djNpcDhfdlJmTzN0ZVIyX2F0dDRvZ1VRZzZKVVpxRG1pYTFJWjA3OEhzMmg3Umd1WnozUC1rSnRqWG9XaTZnQl9UbHl4UTZSRVpvY2YzUmlkX2FIR3NQbDU0aGljMC0wcTlfYU1jRlp2X3Z1RmdMb1NVNUxVUzhzUXFBRUhKMmFGSWtlTGlQdEFJOUpYTDRzbG5ua3FVR0hISFdQVElneEs3d2JTSVk0ay1xTi11dkJn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Manila Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOYTBSalU3ZGU0TU9nQnktTlAzdUstd2tBLWlCLTZ1dWJKUFBTYWZsZTB3TGxsVVlCRUMxTXIxckhDMk90TnVEb0xEZGN5ZThULW1heWFDT0hYdDRWSzNfZzFxU3NhSDd2UFZhRXZ0WWFXS3pXTkhscnpLb05CNDl0aDc1Mkl3SHZFeGFXNFB2em5QUUY5OE1Obm4tNE4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;GMA Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Internazionale&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQV3hGbHVkdzlvRmNzS1pNS1czSkFRaVNfM1NVTGhrV3g3LWxQN3F2dVp6RVI3bXJuQklSUVVZdWxEMWh5Sl91QlF3dzJZSXMzWUVoa1pBcUZlMTN5b1FtdXBuZm42cGhhTEFsVklvLTYwc3FMU0gxbEFwM0hvVzlQTG9VdTJpQXlJY3F4SGZFbEV5VUdsajY1OGdKUnlITERUNXozY